#!/usr/bin/env bash

##	Purpose:
##		- Runs the newest dogfood build of tukfs-hash. dogfood_tukfs-hash.ps1
##		  takes a new build in, rotates the pool and prints which to run, and
##		  this runs it in its own place, with every argument but --no-update
##		  as typed. So its exit code and a Ctrl+C reach it untouched.
##		- Lives in util/linux/bash, and the .ps1 in util/0_crossplatform beside
##		  it. The repo keeps both in utility/.
##	History: At bottom of script.

